{
  "$note": "僕役宮（2026-10-12）：太陽.僕役。《深造講義》下篇 宮垣論 僕役宮 p.516–530。官非、盜竊、色禍、受出賣、乘人之危一類斷語不用；天姚、陰煞、天巫、天刑等引擎冇嘅星不用；要分廟陷嘅條文暫不用。原書交友宮主下屬、晚輩，兼論朋友。",
  "topic": {
    "id": "太陽.僕役",
    "palace": "僕役",
    "stars": [
      "太陽"
    ]
  },
  "rules": [
    {
      "id": "僕役.太陽.廟",
      "role": "refine",
      "when": {
        "all": [
          {
            "bright": "high",
            "star": "太陽"
          },
          {
            "not": {
              "star": [
                "太陰",
                "天梁"
              ],
              "at": "same"
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "text": "太陽光熱充足，你交遊廣闊，認識的人多。",
      "en": "Tai Yang shines strongly: your circle is wide and you know many people.",
      "source": {
        "passage": "deep.僕役.太陽.7",
        "quote": "但唯入庙然后始主交游广阔"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "僕役.太陽.陷",
      "role": "refine",
      "when": {
        "all": [
          {
            "bright": "low",
            "star": "太陽"
          },
          {
            "not": {
              "star": "太陰",
              "at": "same"
            }
          },
          {
            "not": {
              "hua": "祿",
              "star": "太陽",
              "at": "same"
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "text": "太陽光熱不足，你相識的人不多，也談不上深交；對朋友、下屬施恩，往往得不到回報。",
      "en": "Tai Yang shines weakly: you know few people well, and kindness to friends or staff often goes unrewarded.",
      "source": {
        "passage": "deep.僕役.太陽.8",
        "quote": "亦主施恩无功"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "僕役.太陽.火鈴",
      "role": "refine",
      "when": {
        "star": [
          "火星",
          "鈴星"
        ],
        "at": "same"
      },
      "text": "太陽與火星或鈴星同宮，你和朋友之間多爭執。",
      "en": "Tai Yang with Huo Xing or Ling Xing: there is a good deal of arguing among your friends.",
      "source": {
        "passage": "deep.僕役.太陽.9",
        "quote": "与火铃同度，主多争"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "僕役.太陽.朝拱",
      "role": "refine",
      "when": {
        "all": [
          {
            "star": [
              "左輔",
              "右弼"
            ],
            "at": "sifang"
          },
          {
            "star": [
              "天魁",
              "天鉞"
            ],
            "at": "sifang"
          }
        ]
      },
      "text": "太陽得眾星拱照，你可以結交有地位的朋友。",
      "en": "Tai Yang is surrounded by helper stars: you can make friends with people of standing.",
      "source": {
        "passage": "deep.僕役.太陽.10",
        "quote": "主得交贵友"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "僕役.太陽.祿",
      "role": "refine",
      "when": {
        "hua": "祿",
        "star": "太陽",
        "at": "same"
      },
      "text": "太陽化祿，你的朋友圈廣，來往的人來自各方。",
      "en": "Tai Yang in Abundance: your circle is wide, with people from all directions.",
      "source": {
        "passage": "deep.僕役.太陽.11",
        "quote": "化禄，主交游广"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "僕役.太陽.權",
      "role": "refine",
      "when": {
        "hua": "權",
        "star": "太陽",
        "at": "same"
      },
      "text": "太陽化權，你和朋友、下屬的關係容易穩定下來。",
      "en": "Tai Yang in Authority: your ties with friends and staff settle easily.",
      "source": {
        "passage": "deep.僕役.太陽.11",
        "quote": "化权，主关系易稳定"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "僕役.太陽.羊陀",
      "role": "limit",
      "when": {
        "star": [
          "擎羊",
          "陀羅"
        ],
        "at": "same"
      },
      "text": "同宮有擎羊或陀羅，你和朋友之間多是非，或受牽累。",
      "en": "With Qing Yang or Tuo Luo in the palace, friends bring talk or trouble.",
      "source": {
        "passage": "deep.僕役.太陽.12",
        "quote": "太阳与擎羊同度，增加是非"
      }
    }
  ]
}